<!-- ===== HEADER ===== -->
<div class="report-header">
  <div class="header-tag">Energy Policy Research &bull; Trend Analysis</div>
  <h1>Global Fuel Price Trends &amp; Policy Impact Analysis<br>(2020–2026)</h1>
  <div class="header-subtitle">A comprehensive analysis of retail fuel prices across 84 countries, examining how Brent Crude benchmark movements translate to consumer costs under varying subsidy regimes, taxation structures, and income conditions.</div>
  <div class="header-meta">
    <div class="header-meta-item"><strong>Dataset Coverage</strong>84 Countries · 7 Regions · 327 Weekly Observations</div>
    <div class="header-meta-item"><strong>Period</strong>January 2020 – April 2026</div>
    <div class="header-meta-item"><strong>Fuel Types</strong>Petrol · Diesel · LPG</div>
    <div class="header-meta-item"><strong>Prepared</strong>April 2026</div>
